LOCATION:1705 N 16th St Tampa \, FL 33605 United States
DESCRIPTION:Join us for Movida 2026: A Movement\, Not a Moment\, an immers
 ive\, multigenerational celebration of Latinx stories\, healing\, and comm
 unity power. Movida creates a joyful\, justice-rooted space where Latine s
 tories\, traditions\, and futures come together. Open to all ages and all 
 walks of life\, the event brings the community together to support\, conne
 ct\, and celebrate Latinx artists\, performers\, and business owners repre
 senting a spectrum of identities\, generations\, and cultural heritages ac
 ross the Latine diaspora. Experience includes:  Art exhibition  Live perfo
 rmances  Vendor market  Curated panel discussion  Family activities \n\nPe
