SUMMARY:Red Bull Dance Your Style National Final
LOCATION:Tampa Convention Center 333 S Franklin St Tampa \, FL 33602 Unite
 d States
DESCRIPTION:Red Bull Dance Your Style is an all-styles\, 1-on-1 street dan
 ce competition built around freestyle\, musical adaptability\, and crowd c
 onnection. Dancers battle to surprise tracks selected live\, forcing them 
 to interpret music on the fly and showcase their individuality through mov
 ement. Join us on September 19 as the nations best street dancers compete 
