SUMMARY:Teen Ceramics
LOCATION:120 W Gasparilla Plaza Tampa \, FL 33602 United States
DESCRIPTION:Wednesdays\, Oct 14 - Nov 18  4:30 - 6:00 PM (6 classes) Ages 
 13-17  Beginner-Intermediate Level Interested in diving into the world of 
 ceramics? Take this beginner-friendly course specifically for teens! Get o
