 er 17\, bringing a powerhouse lineup headlined by Diamond-certified Countr
 y superstar Thomas Rhett. This years festival will also feature GRAMMY-nom
 inated trio Midland\, acclaimed singer-songwriter Kameron Marlowe\, belove
 d Florida natives Sister Hazel\, and up-and-coming country voice Cassidy D
 aniels. Presented by RIPA\, Valley Bank\, and The Baldwin Group\, this awa
 rd-winning event brings together world-class live music\, great food\, gam
